{
  "title": { "zh": "核对奇偶" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-32\"></level-ref>在发送的一方附上校验位。这一次换到收的一方：线照样会翻位，每个字节都要核对。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1-14",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "从第一拍起，线上接连送来字节，每个后跟一个校验位，使这 9 位里 1 的个数为偶数；线会翻位。每个校验位到达的那一拍，输出收到的字节和校验是否相符，其余各拍为「—」。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-32\"></level-ref>里跟着记奇偶的办法，收的一方也用得上。"
        },
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"xor\"></part-ref>把记下的奇偶和新来的一位合成新的奇偶。"
        },
        {
          "zh": "字节一个接一个，中间没有空拍：每 9 拍从头算起。"
        }
      ],
      "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线" } }] },
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "字节" } },
        { "name": "ok", "label": { "zh": "相符" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [65], "format": "parity" }] } } },
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [0, 255], "format": "parity" }], "flips": [3] } } },
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [170, 85], "format": "parity" }], "flips": [10, 12] } } }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [7, 7, 7], "format": "parity" }], "flips": [17] } } },
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [128, 64], "format": "parity" }], "flips": [0] } } }
      ],
      "want": {
        "byte": { "decoded": { "wire": "line", "format": "parity" } },
        "ok": { "intact": { "wire": "line", "format": "parity" } }
      },
      "solution": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "eight = const[value=8]()",
        "g = reg[reg=A, start=1]()",
        "c = counter(g)",
        "e8 = equal(c, eight)",
        "ka = keep[reg=A](e8)",
        "d = deserializer(line, g)",
        "rb = reg[reg=B, start=0]()",
        "kb = keep[reg=B](d.byte)",
        "y = select(e8, rb)",
        "byte <- y",
        "pr = reg[reg=C, start=0]()",
        "base = select(g, z, pr)",
        "x = xor(base, line)",
        "kc = keep[reg=C](x)",
        "ok0 = equal(x, z)",
        "okv = select(e8, ok0)",
        "ok <- okv"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "eight = const[value=8]()",
        "g = reg[reg=A, start=1]()",
        "c = counter(g)",
        "e8 = equal(c, eight)",
        "ka = keep[reg=A](e8)",
        "d = deserializer(line, g)",
        "rb = reg[reg=B, start=0]()",
        "kb = keep[reg=B](d.byte)",
        "y = select(e8, rb)",
        "byte <- y",
        "pr = reg[reg=C, start=0]()",
        "x = xor(pr, line)",
        "kc = keep[reg=C](x)",
        "ok0 = equal(x, z)",
        "okv = select(e8, ok0)",
        "ok <- okv"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
